[l_english.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_MYTHIC_STAFF]
Mythic Staff (Witchcraft)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_MYTHIC_STAFF_desc]
The mythic staff, it is said to contain the power of a thousand sunsets and the wisdom of a dozen ancient alicorns, all neatly packaged in a luxurious crystal and gold casing. However, it’s so expensive and valuable that using it in a magical battle would be like using a golden toilet paper roll to clean up a spilled cup of tea. Sure, it would get the job done, but at what cost? Only the most extravagant and eccentric ponies would dare to wield such a treasure, while the rest of us make a living with regular, non-mythic staff.
§g“Dude, how much did you even spent in this game?”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_MYTHIC_STAFF_short]
Mythic Staff

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_MYTHIC_STAFF]
神话法杖 (巫术装备)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_MYTHIC_STAFF_desc]
这根神话般的法杖，据说蕴含着一千次日落的力量和十几只远古天角兽的智慧，全部干净地包装在它奢华的水晶和黄金外壳中。然而，它是如此地昂贵和有价值，以至于在魔法战斗中使用它就像用金子做的卫生纸卷清理一杯洒出的茶一样。当然，它可以完成工作，但代价是什么？只有最奢侈、最古怪的小马才敢使用这样的宝藏，而我们其他小马则只能使用普通的、非神话的法杖度日。
§g“哥们，你到底在这个游戏里充了多少钱？”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_WITCHCRAFT_MYTHIC_STAFF_short]
神话法杖
